<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-STRUZHANI H1 LOSS 12,835 LATS.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-STRUZHANI H1 LOSS 12,835 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Struzhani Peat made a first-half net loss of 12,835 lats on net turnover of 65,751 lats, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The company had gross profit of 4,237 lats but was pushed into a loss by administrative expenses of 11,756 lats.</p>
<p>The company's assets at the end of the first half were 610,740 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
